<title>DUBAI: UAE leader arrives in Spain after neck surgery.</title>
<headline>UAE leader arrives in Spain after neck surgery.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan arrived in Spain on Thursday following a successful neck surgery in the United States, the official WAM news agency said.</p>
<p>WAM described his visit as private and did not say when he was expected to return home.</p>
<p>The 78-year-old leader of the UAE, a major oil producer, underwent surgery on a vertebra in his neck at the Mayo Clinic in Minnesota on September 27.</p>
</text>
